      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA AURORA (4) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Q Lakeside behind Regal Wolf (21.73) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from six starts. Can find winning form. HOPE'S JACKY (3) turned in a better effort at Q Lakeside last start, finishing second behind Scrub's Blue (21.84) in a Grade 3/4. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Will give a great sight again. GRUBBER KICK (8) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 1.5 lengths at Q Lakeside in a handy 19.78. Draws out wide but has the ability and in winning form. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. ANOTHER IDEA (2) cannot be ruled out.",
